OL,4,CMexican soldiers attacked in wake of   
OL,5,Cdrug lord's arrest                     
OL,6,GMexican soldiers have detained eight   
OL,7,Galleged members of a drug cartel whose 
OL,8,Gleader was arrested on Friday,         
OL,9,Gsparking a wave of violence in         
OL,10,Gnorthern Sinaloa state.                
OL,12,FThe Mexican defence ministry said the  
OL,13,Fsoldiers were shot by the suspects on  
OL,14,FSunday while on patrol in the town of  
OL,15,FSinaloa de Leyva, trying to re-        
OL,16,Festablish order in the wake of the     
OL,17,Farrest of Fausto Isidro Meza Flores.   
OL,19,FMeza Flores, also known as "Chapo      
OL,20,FIsidro", was on the FBI's 10 most      
OL,21,Fwanted list and had managed to evade   
OL,22,Fcapture for years.                     
